  <h1>Phase 2 Learning Task: Watchlist</h1>
  <p><b>Goal:</b> Learn Spring Boot APIs and React by building a small Watchlist module.</p>
  <p><b>Do this by typing yourself.</b> This guide only tells you where each file goes and gives simple code.</p>

  <h2>What You Are Building</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>POST</b> add a stock to watchlist</li>
    <li><b>GET</b> show all watchlist stocks</li>
    <li><b>PUT</b> update note for a watchlist stock</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Backend Folder Pattern</h2>
  <p>Your auth service currently uses this modular pattern:</p>
  <pre><code>controller
dto
entity
repository
service</code></pre>

  <p>For learning, add Watchlist in the same style. You can place it in a new service later. For now, if you practice inside auth-service, create these files:</p>

  <pre><code>backend/auth-service/src/main/java/com/marketquest/auth_service/
  controller/WatchlistController.java
  dto/WatchlistRequest.java
  entity/WatchlistItem.java
  repository/WatchlistRepository.java
  service/WatchlistService.java</code></pre>

  <h2>Backend Code</h2>

  <h3 class="path">entity/WatchlistItem.java</h3>
  <pre><code>package com.marketquest.auth_service.entity;

import jakarta.persistence.*;

@Entity
public class WatchlistItem {
    @Id
    @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)
    private Long id;

    private String symbol;
    private String companyName;
    private String note;

    public Long getId() { return id; }
    public void setId(Long id) { this.id = id; }

    public String getSymbol() { return symbol; }
    public void setSymbol(String symbol) { this.symbol = symbol; }

    public String getCompanyName() { return companyName; }
    public void setCompanyName(String companyName) { this.companyName = companyName; }

    public String getNote() { return note; }
    public void setNote(String note) { this.note = note; }
}</code></pre>

  <h3 class="path">dto/WatchlistRequest.java</h3>
  <pre><code>package com.marketquest.auth_service.dto;

public class WatchlistRequest {
    private String symbol;
    private String companyName;
    private String note;

    public String getSymbol() { return symbol; }
    public void setSymbol(String symbol) { this.symbol = symbol; }

    public String getCompanyName() { return companyName; }
    public void setCompanyName(String companyName) { this.companyName = companyName; }

    public String getNote() { return note; }
    public void setNote(String note) { this.note = note; }
}</code></pre>

  <h3 class="path">repository/WatchlistRepository.java</h3>
  <pre><code>package com.marketquest.auth_service.repository;

import com.marketquest.auth_service.entity.WatchlistItem;
import org.springframework.data.jpa.repository.JpaRepository;

public interface WatchlistRepository extends JpaRepository&lt;WatchlistItem, Long&gt; {
}</code></pre>

  <h3 class="path">service/WatchlistService.java</h3>
  <pre><code>package com.marketquest.auth_service.service;

import com.marketquest.auth_service.dto.WatchlistRequest;
import com.marketquest.auth_service.entity.WatchlistItem;
import com.marketquest.auth_service.repository.WatchlistRepository;
import org.springframework.stereotype.Service;

import java.util.List;

@Service
public class WatchlistService {
    private final WatchlistRepository watchlistRepository;

    public WatchlistService(WatchlistRepository watchlistRepository) {
        this.watchlistRepository = watchlistRepository;
    }

    public List&lt;WatchlistItem&gt; getAllStocks() {
        return watchlistRepository.findAll();
    }

    public WatchlistItem addStock(WatchlistRequest request) {
        WatchlistItem item = new WatchlistItem();
        item.setSymbol(request.getSymbol());
        item.setCompanyName(request.getCompanyName());
        item.setNote(request.getNote());
        return watchlistRepository.save(item);
    }

    public WatchlistItem updateNote(Long id, WatchlistRequest request) {
        WatchlistItem item = watchlistRepository.findById(id)
                .orElseThrow(() -> new RuntimeException("Stock not found"));

        item.setNote(request.getNote());
        return watchlistRepository.save(item);
    }
}</code></pre>

  <h3 class="path">controller/WatchlistController.java</h3>
  <pre><code>package com.marketquest.auth_service.controller;

import com.marketquest.auth_service.dto.WatchlistRequest;
import com.marketquest.auth_service.entity.WatchlistItem;
import com.marketquest.auth_service.service.WatchlistService;
import org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.*;

import java.util.List;

@RestController
@RequestMapping("/api/watchlist")
@CrossOrigin(origins = "*")
public class WatchlistController {
    private final WatchlistService watchlistService;

    public WatchlistController(WatchlistService watchlistService) {
        this.watchlistService = watchlistService;
    }

    @GetMapping
    public List&lt;WatchlistItem&gt; getAllStocks() {
        return watchlistService.getAllStocks();
    }

    @PostMapping
    public WatchlistItem addStock(@RequestBody WatchlistRequest request) {
        return watchlistService.addStock(request);
    }

    @PutMapping("/{id}")
    public WatchlistItem updateNote(@PathVariable Long id, @RequestBody WatchlistRequest request) {
        return watchlistService.updateNote(id, request);
    }
}</code></pre>

  <h2>Frontend Folder Pattern</h2>
  <p>Your frontend currently uses:</p>
  <pre><code>frontendr/src/api
frontendr/src/features
frontendr/src/pages
frontendr/src/routes</code></pre>

  <p>Create these files:</p>
  <pre><code>frontendr/src/api/watchlistApi.js
frontendr/src/features/watchlist/watchlistSlice.js
frontendr/src/pages/Watchlist.jsx</code></pre>

  <p>Then update this existing file:</p>
  <pre><code>frontendr/src/routes/AppRoutes.jsx</code></pre>

  <h2>Frontend Code</h2>

  <h3 class="path">api/watchlistApi.js</h3>
  <pre><code>import apiClient from "./apiClient";

export const getWatchlistApi = () => {
  return apiClient.get("/watchlist");
};

export const addWatchlistApi = (data) => {
  return apiClient.post("/watchlist", data);
};

export const updateWatchlistNoteApi = (id, data) => {
  return apiClient.put(`/watchlist/${id}`, data);
};</code></pre>

  <h3 class="path">features/watchlist/watchlistSlice.js</h3>
  <pre><code>import { createAsyncThunk, createSlice } from "@reduxjs/toolkit";
import {
  addWatchlistApi,
  getWatchlistApi,
  updateWatchlistNoteApi,
} from "../../api/watchlistApi";

export const fetchWatchlist = createAsyncThunk("watchlist/fetch", async () => {
  const response = await getWatchlistApi();
  return response.data;
});

export const addWatchlistStock = createAsyncThunk("watchlist/add", async (data) => {
  const response = await addWatchlistApi(data);
  return response.data;
});

export const updateWatchlistNote = createAsyncThunk("watchlist/updateNote", async ({ id, note }) => {
  const response = await updateWatchlistNoteApi(id, { note });
  return response.data;
});

const watchlistSlice = createSlice({
  name: "watchlist",
  initialState: {
    items: [],
    loading: false,
    error: null,
  },
  reducers: {},
  extraReducers: (builder) => {
    builder
      .addCase(fetchWatchlist.pending, (state) => {
        state.loading = true;
      })
      .addCase(fetchWatchlist.fulfilled, (state, action) => {
        state.loading = false;
        state.items = action.payload;
      })
      .addCase(fetchWatchlist.rejected, (state) => {
        state.loading = false;
        state.error = "Failed to load watchlist";
      })
      .addCase(addWatchlistStock.fulfilled, (state, action) => {
        state.items.push(action.payload);
      })
      .addCase(updateWatchlistNote.fulfilled, (state, action) => {
        const index = state.items.findIndex((item) => item.id === action.payload.id);
        if (index !== -1) {
          state.items[index] = action.payload;
        }
      });
  },
});

export default watchlistSlice.reducer;</code></pre>

  <h3 class="path">store/store.js</h3>
  <p>Add watchlist reducer inside existing reducer object.</p>
  <pre><code>import watchlistReducer from "../features/watchlist/watchlistSlice";

// inside configureStore reducer:
watchlist: watchlistReducer,</code></pre>

  <h3 class="path">pages/Watchlist.jsx</h3>
  <pre><code>import { useEffect, useState } from "react";
import { useDispatch, useSelector } from "react-redux";
import {
  addWatchlistStock,
  fetchWatchlist,
  updateWatchlistNote,
} from "../features/watchlist/watchlistSlice";

const Watchlist = () => {
  const dispatch = useDispatch();
  const { items, loading, error } = useSelector((state) => state.watchlist);
  const [form, setForm] = useState({
    symbol: "",
    companyName: "",
    note: "",
  });

  useEffect(() => {
    dispatch(fetchWatchlist());
  }, [dispatch]);

  const handleChange = (e) => {
    setForm({ ...form, [e.target.name]: e.target.value });
  };

  const handleSubmit = async (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    await dispatch(addWatchlistStock(form));
    setForm({ symbol: "", companyName: "", note: "" });
  };

  const handleUpdateNote = (id) => {
    const note = prompt("Enter new note");
    if (note) {
      dispatch(updateWatchlistNote({ id, note }));
    }
  };

  return (
    &lt;main&gt;
      &lt;h1&gt;Watchlist&lt;/h1&gt;

      &lt;form onSubmit={handleSubmit}&gt;
        &lt;input name="symbol" placeholder="TCS" value={form.symbol} onChange={handleChange} required /&gt;
        &lt;input name="companyName" placeholder="Company name" value={form.companyName} onChange={handleChange} required /&gt;
        &lt;input name="note" placeholder="My note" value={form.note} onChange={handleChange} /&gt;
        &lt;button type="submit"&gt;Add&lt;/button&gt;
      &lt;/form&gt;

      {loading && &lt;p&gt;Loading...&lt;/p&gt;}
      {error && &lt;p&gt;{error}&lt;/p&gt;}

      &lt;ul&gt;
        {items.map((item) =&gt; (
          &lt;li key={item.id}&gt;
            &lt;strong&gt;{item.symbol}&lt;/strong&gt; - {item.companyName}
            &lt;p&gt;{item.note}&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; handleUpdateNote(item.id)}&gt;Update Note&lt;/button&gt;
          &lt;/li&gt;
        ))}
      &lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/main&gt;
  );
};

export default Watchlist;</code></pre>

  <h3 class="path">routes/AppRoutes.jsx</h3>
  <p>Add import:</p>
  <pre><code>import Watchlist from "../pages/Watchlist";</code></pre>
  <p>Add route:</p>
  <pre><code>&lt;Route path="/watchlist" element={&lt;ProtectedRoute&gt;&lt;Watchlist /&gt;&lt;/ProtectedRoute&gt;} /&gt;</code></pre>

  <h2>Testing Order</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>First create backend files.</li>
    <li>Run backend.</li>
    <li>Test APIs in Postman.</li>
    <li>Then create frontend files.</li>
    <li>Add reducer to store.</li>
    <li>Add route.</li>
    <li>Open <code>/watchlist</code> after login.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2>Postman Examples</h2>
  <h3>POST http://localhost:8081/api/watchlist</h3>
  <pre><code>{
  "symbol": "TCS",
  "companyName": "Tata Consultancy Services",
  "note": "Track this IT stock"
}</code></pre>

  <h3>GET http://localhost:8081/api/watchlist</h3>
  <pre><code>No request body.</code></pre>

  <h3>PUT http://localhost:8081/api/watchlist/1</h3>
  <pre><code>{
  "note": "Updated note"
}</code></pre>

  <h2>Important Learning Point</h2>
  <p>Controller receives HTTP request. Service contains business logic. Repository talks to database. React page displays UI. API file talks to backend. Redux slice stores frontend data.</p>
</body>
